WAP to Handle Null Pointer Exception:
package exceptionnullpointer;

public class ExceptionNullPointer {

    public static void main(String[] args) {
         String s=null;
        
        try{
            s.length();
        }
        catch (NullPointerException e) {
            System.out.println("String is null. Cannot perform the operation.");
        }
    
    }
    
}

OUTPUT:
String is null. Cannot perform the operation.
